78 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 42 0 R/T(Biomechanics is the study of biology and the mechanisms of movement. )/E(Biomechanics is the study of biology and the mechanisms of movement. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

79 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 42 0 R/T(Birth is not just about contractions, it\220s about movement. Your baby must navigate your pelvis, rotate, and flex to pass through the birth canal efficiently. This is where birth biomechanics comes in: the study of how your body and your baby move together during pregnancy and labour.)/E(Birth is not just about contractions, it\220s about movement. Your baby must navigate your pelvis, rotate, and flex to pass through the birth canal efficiently. This is where birth biomechanics comes in: the study of how your body and your baby move together during pregnancy and labour.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

