<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 42 0 R/T(Simple tools, upright positions, gentle rocking, hip circles, hands and knees, or leaning forward can make a big difference. However understanding the mechanics of birth turns labour from a passive experience into an empowered, supported one, especially when adaptations are needed.)/E(Simple tools, upright positions, gentle rocking, hip circles, hands and knees, or leaning forward can make a big difference. However understanding the mechanics of birth turns labour from a passive experience into an empowered, supported one, especially when adaptations are needed.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
