645 0 obj
<</Title(Place the heels of your palm on the side of the hip/pelvis \(finger tips pointing towards each other, and squeeze during the duration of the contraction.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 631 0 R/Prev 656 0 R/Next 637 0 R>>
endobj

646 0 obj
<</Title(This technique uses a \217static stretch\220 to temporarily enlarge and soften the pelvis. It can be done weekly to maintain  balance and stability, help baby to rotate into an optimal  position and encourage regular contractions. It can also ease back and labour discomfort.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 634 0 R/Prev 638 0 R/First 657 0 R/Last 657 0 R/Count -1/Next 658 0 R>>
