653 0 obj
<</Title(This technique aids rotation and descent of baby\220s head by opening the mid-pelvis. Lifting one leg can help create more room for baby to rotate into a good position. Can be used when labour has slowed and is a useful upright position to adopt in labour.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 635 0 R/Prev 642 0 R/Next 664 0 R>>
endobj

